/*
  SONIC BONGO / PRISMA
  ESP32-S3 N16R8 - Dual Sensor Bongo v16 CONTINUOUS FUNCTION

  CONFIRMED WIRING (unchanged):
    S1: GPIO13 -> TRIG direct
        HC-SR04 ECHO -> TXS B1 -> A1 -> GPIO14
    S2: GPIO15 -> TRIG direct
        HC-SR04 ECHO -> TXS B2 -> A2 -> GPIO16

  v16:
    - Preserve v15 calibration/acquisition and NVS namespace.
    - Two UI tabs: CALIBRACION and FUNCION.
    - The white point becomes a continuous signal Y(t).
    - Derive velocity V(t), acceleration A(t), descent, local minimum and rebound.
    - Candidate strokes are detected from waveform shape, NOT a fixed hit plane.
    - Repeated candidates are classified as continuous/ROLL using period/frequency.
    - All detector variables are configurable, persisted and linked to plots/math.
*/
